# =============================================================================
# tdl_loc.xdc -- bit-exact placement for both tap delay lines AND their
#                snapshot capture flip-flops.
#
# GENERATED from the achieved placement of impl_1 by harvest_placement.tcl.
# Do not hand-edit. Regenerate if the hierarchy changes.
#
#   chan_a  CARRY4  SLICE_X37 Y30..Y117   tap_reg  same slices, AFF/BFF/CFF/DFF
#   chan_b  CARRY4  SLICE_X48 Y31..Y118   tap_reg  same slices, AFF/BFF/CFF/DFF
#
# WHY THE CARRY4 SITES ARE LOCKED
#   The per-tap delays ARE the instrument. A calibration LUT derived from one
#   placement is meaningless on another. Unconstrained, the placer re-sites
#   the chains on every run and silently invalidates the LUT -- no error, no
#   warning, just numbers that quietly stop being right.
#
# WHY THE TAP FLOPS ARE LOCKED TOO
#   tap_reg[4i+j] sits in the SAME slice as carry_loop[i], on BEL {A,B,C,D}FF
#   for j={0,1,2,3}. That routes every tap through the dedicated intra-slice
#   CO[j] -> xMUX -> xFF path, so the capture skew is IDENTICAL across all 352
#   taps. If the placer scatters these instead, the skew becomes non-uniform
#   and appears in the code-density histogram as structure that looks like
#   delay-line non-linearity but is not. This layout was achieved by the
#   placer unaided; locking it stops a later run from losing it.
#
# CLOCK-REGION CROSSINGS (measured, clock_regions.txt)
#   A carry chain gains extra delay crossing a clock-region boundary: one
#   very wide bin. It is REAL, reproducible, and absorbed correctly by a
#   per-bin LUT. Expect it at:
#       chan_a  tap  80 (X1Y0->X1Y1)   tap 280 (X1Y1->X1Y2)
#       chan_b  tap  76 (X1Y0->X1Y1)   tap 276 (X1Y1->X1Y2)
#   Spanning the full 5 ns needs 88 CARRY4 (352 taps); one clock region holds
#   only 50 CARRY4 (200 taps, ~3.5 ns). Crossing is therefore UNAVOIDABLE with
#   this architecture -- it is not a placement defect and must not be 'fixed'.
#
# DO NOT add CONTAIN_ROUTING to any pblock covering these chains: it makes the
# tap fanout unroutable.
# =============================================================================

# ============ chan_a : CARRY4 delay line (88 cells) ============
set_property LOC SLICE_X37Y30   [get_cells {core/chan_a/tdl_inst/carry_loop[0].carry4_inst}]
